  unitName: Rift Guide Sedrac (EU)
  unitId: 760215
  unitNumber: 7170
  description: "Once Sagrav had been defeated and peace restored, Sedrac was able
    to resume his studies. His attention was naturally attracted to this new kind
    of portal through which Llewxam, his lifelong friend, had disappeared. Swiftly,
    he presented to his peers the conclusion (still contested today) that the latter
    could endanger the mirror world. Despite much controversy, the sages arrived
    at the consensus that an academy of explorers should be established. These members
    were given the responsibility of surveying and documenting the strange space
    beyond the portal, known as the Rift.Nobody at the academy had any doubts about
    Sedrac\u2019s secret motives and many explorers began to be reluctant to explore
    the rifts in his company, finding him to be more and more obsessed. In everybody\u2019s
    opinion, Sedrac was ignoring his own limits in a way that the academy considered
    a little dangerous...."
  summonDesc: Exploration awaits, Summoner!
  fusionDesc: This road I'm on, it's merely the beginning.
